|RECORD=4|OWNERPARTID=-1|LOCATION.X=875|LOCATION.Y=442|COLOR=8388608|FONTID=2|TEXT=DESIGN / LAYOUT NOTES
|RECORD=4|OWNERPARTID=-1|LOCATION.X=885|LOCATION.Y=398|COLOR=8388608|FONTID=1|TEXT=01  Keep the VIN-C2-U1-GND switching loop short.
|RECORD=4|OWNERPARTID=-1|LOCATION.X=885|LOCATION.Y=364|COLOR=8388608|FONTID=1|TEXT=02  Place C4 at U1 pins 6 and 5; keep SW copper compact.
|RECORD=4|OWNERPARTID=-1|LOCATION.X=885|LOCATION.Y=330|COLOR=8388608|FONTID=1|TEXT=03  Route FB away from SW, L1 and pump return current.
|RECORD=4|OWNERPARTID=-1|LOCATION.X=885|LOCATION.Y=296|COLOR=8388608|FONTID=1|TEXT=04  Place D2 near J2/Q2 and use a short pump return loop.
|RECORD=4|OWNERPARTID=-1|LOCATION.X=885|LOCATION.Y=262|COLOR=8388608|FONTID=1|TEXT=05  VIN_P supplies both the buck converter and the pump.
|RECORD=4|OWNERPARTID=-1|LOCATION.X=885|LOCATION.Y=228|COLOR=8388608|FONTID=1|TEXT=06  F1 remains 0.5 A from V0.9: check pump startup current.
|RECORD=4|OWNERPARTID=-1|LOCATION.X=885|LOCATION.Y=194|COLOR=8388608|FONTID=1|TEXT=07  This revision reorganizes wiring; original values retained.
|RECORD=4|OWNERPARTID=-1|LOCATION.X=885|LOCATION.Y=160|COLOR=8388608|FONTID=1|TEXT=08  PCB footprints / load-current validation are not included.
